{"channelId":"UC0_ag5gZK8PZIEpGHrsU_dA","row":["SASHAFarmAnimalSanctuary",2370,"SASHA Farm Animal Sanctuary is located in Manchester, Michigan and we are the Midwest's largest farm animal sanctuary.  At our shelter, not only do we provide food, water, shelter, and veterinary care, we also give the animal residents affection, social interaction with others of their own species, and a sense of security.  The sanctuary currently shelters over 200 animals, each with its own story to tell.  Some were dumped and discarded, some were left to die.  They have come from unhappy circumstances, often mistreated or neglected, but now have a safe, permanent home at SASHA Farm.","office@sashafarm.org; donations@sashafarm.org","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0_ag5gZK8PZIEpGHrsU_dA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0_ag5gZK8PZIEpGHrsU_dA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:54.566Z","channelId":"UC0_ag5gZK8PZIEpGHrsU_dA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"63b409ba6487eca6a19926b63e7c84c915144a6fb6ad6856af6ec28e7692e07c","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"dee9c51a33c7d4baf632a52a7eb9c8ab129c80d1542b07865ddbc3c19c586be2"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0_ag5gZK8PZIEpGHrsU_dA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:54.566Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0_ag5gZK8PZIEpGHrsU_dA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":2370,"raw":"2.37K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0_ag5gZK8PZIEpGHrsU_dA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:54.566Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"office@sashafarm.org","purpose":"general","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"cross_linked","sourceUrls":["https://www.sashafarm.org/contact/"],"evidenceIds":["public-page:df31a3c67b96c3f3e55b6368"],"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:30:27.681Z","deliveryVerified":false,"dnsStatus":"unknown","context":"页面原文: Feel free to email us a